'''Molch''' is a small settlement found in the [[Kebos Swamp]], a swamp in the [[Kebos Lowlands]]. It is inhabited by [[lizardmen]]. A lizardman shaman named [[Ek'ans Chan]] can be seen chanting. In addition, two enclosures containing unattackable [[swamp frog]]s can be found, suggesting the lizardmen use them as a source of food.

A {{WP|step pyramid}} can be found here with an [[Altar (Xeric)|altar]] dedicated to [[Xeric]]. In addition, there are four [[lizard dwelling|entrances]] to the [[Lizardman Temple]], containing six [[lizardman shaman]]s in a single-way combat area.

A quick way to travel to Molch is to use a [[Skills necklace]] to teleport to the [[Farming Guild]] and run south across the bridge and through the swamp. Another quick way is to use the [[fairy ring]] code {{Fairycode|DJR}}, running south-west and taking the [[Boaty]] directly to Molch.
[[File:Molch step pyramid.png|thumb|left|The step pyramid just west of the village.]]

